  "solution": "Vì đồ thị đi qua các điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> và <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tVì đồ thị đi qua điểm <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇔</mo><mi>b</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.(1)<br>\n\t\tHàm số có điểm cực đại là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">CD</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>′</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>b</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>b</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>28</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>28</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tTừ (1), suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>, khi đó <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>28</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>45</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tKhinh khí cầu cách mặt đất <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3875</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (m)</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>875</mn><mrow><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\"> (km)</mtext></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>, nên ta có\n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>875</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>45</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>28</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇔</mo><mn>5</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>56</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>625</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>148</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">,</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\"